From: RNSBox <rnsbox@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] riscv: dts: sophgo: add the CV18xx watchdog and thermal sensor

The CV1800B/SG2000/SG2002 family shares the DesignWare APB watchdog
(0x3010000) and the TEMPSEN thermal sensor (0x30e0000). Add both nodes
and the soc-thermal zone (passive 85 C, hot 95 C, critical 110 C) so
every board inherits /dev/watchdog0 and a temperature readout.

The SDHCI clock order is deliberately NOT touched here. The mainline
driver's existing core/bus mapping is what the known-good images used;
swapping it to feed the card clock as "core" made the Module 01 EVB hang
before the console. Restore that fix only after it is proven on hardware.

The thermal sensor needs CONFIG_CV1800_THERMAL from the companion driver
patch; the watchdog needs CONFIG_DW_WATCHDOG.

---
diff --git a/arch/riscv/boot/dts/sophgo/cv180x.dtsi b/arch/riscv/boot/dts/sophgo/cv180x.dtsi
index ec3bf30..1bff8a5 100644
--- a/arch/riscv/boot/dts/sophgo/cv180x.dtsi
+++ b/arch/riscv/boot/dts/sophgo/cv180x.dtsi
@@ -160,6 +160,14 @@
 			};
 		};
 
+		soc_temp: thermal-sensor@30e0000 {
+			compatible = "sophgo,cv1800-thermal";
+			reg = <0x030e0000 0x100>;
+			clocks = <&clk CLK_TEMPSEN>;
+			interrupts = <SOC_PERIPHERAL_IRQ(0) IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>;
+			#thermal-sensor-cells = <0>;
+		};
+
 		saradc: adc@30f0000 {
 			compatible = "sophgo,cv1800b-saradc";
 			reg = <0x030f0000 0x1000>;
@@ -432,6 +440,15 @@
 			status = "disabled";
 		};
 
+		watchdog@3010000 {
+			compatible = "snps,dw-wdt";
+			reg = <0x3010000 0x1000>;
+			clocks = <&clk CLK_APB_WDT>;
+			clock-names = "tclk";
+			resets = <&rst RST_WDT>;
+			interrupts = <SOC_PERIPHERAL_IRQ(42) IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>;
+		};
+
 		usb: usb@4340000 {
 			compatible = "sophgo,cv1800b-usb";
 			reg = <0x04340000 0x10000>;
@@ -478,4 +495,32 @@
 			clock-names = "rtc", "mcu";
 		};
 	};
-};
+	thermal-zones {
+		soc-thermal {
+			polling-delay-passive = <1000>;
+			polling-delay = <1000>;
+			thermal-sensors = <&soc_temp>;
+
+			trips {
+				soc_passive: soc-passive {
+					temperature = <85000>;
+					hysteresis = <5000>;
+					type = "passive";
+				};
+
+				soc_hot: soc-hot {
+					temperature = <95000>;
+					hysteresis = <5000>;
+					type = "hot";
+				};
+
+				soc_critical: soc-critical {
+					temperature = <110000>;
+					hysteresis = <0>;
+					type = "critical";
+				};
+			};
+		};
+	};
+
+};
\ No newline at end of file
